# Opens My notebook in demo mode (AUTORADIO_DEMO=1), once from the tray's glyph and once from the Autoradio page, and asserts what is on the page by test id.
# `expect <id>` means the tree has a view with that testId; `absent <id>` means it has none. Demo mode answers GET /api/texture/edition with the demo notebook
# (fixtures/demo/texture-edition.json and texture-doc-demo-notebook.json, the text of fixtures/learning/notebook.md) and GET /api/autoradio/learning with
# fixtures/demo/learning.json (fixtures/learning/learning.json): 11 settled, 8 of 11 (73%) heard through, 2 open, by kind Story and Podcast clip.
# What only a device or a deployed server can prove: the real routes (the demo answers fixtures), "not available yet" against a server with no learning
# route, the Edit button opening the Texture reader on the live document and a saved edit coming back as the listener's revision, and the topics written
# at onboarding (console: AUTORADIO steer sent=<n> queued=<n> after a more or less tap; no words are logged).
tap bar-mark
clock +600 real
tap place-notebook
clock +1500 real
tree
expect notebook-page
expect notebook-title
expect notebook-edit
expect notebook-refresh
expect notebook-section-asked
expect notebook-section-learned
expect notebook-section-trying
expect notebook-section-steering
expect notebook-line-learned-0
expect notebook-line-tag-learned-0
expect notebook-score-0
expect notebook-score-1
expect notebook-bykind-0
expect notebook-noverdict
expect notebook-held
expect notebook-held-0
absent notebook-behind
shot notebook-top
# A lesson line opens the forecasts behind it; the same tap closes them.
tap notebook-line-learned-0
clock +600 real
tree
expect notebook-behind
expect notebook-behind-text
expect notebook-evidence-0
expect notebook-evidence-2
shot notebook-behind
tap notebook-line-learned-0
clock +600 real
tree
absent notebook-behind
# A line of the listener's own has no forecasts: it says so.
tap notebook-line-asked-0
clock +600 real
tree
expect notebook-evidence-note
absent notebook-evidence-0
shot notebook-own-line
# From the Autoradio page.
tap bar-mark
clock +600 real
tap place-radio
clock +1200 real
tree
expect radio-notebook
tap radio-notebook
clock +1200 real
tree
expect notebook-page
shot notebook-from-radio
